        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;div style=&quot;white-space:normal;line-height:1.25;&quot;&gt;Gane-Sarson: square = external entity; divided rounded rectangle = process; open right side = data store.&lt;br&gt;Stores group exactly the 19 master tables. Hub-managed file bytes and model assets are not additional database tables.&lt;br&gt;Specified design; quiz and sync routes are currently scaffolds. QUEUED_FOR_SYNC is client state. D6 is not a current sync-pull collection.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1" kind="note">
